=== Top-Level Statements: Disambiguation Demo ===
  This class has static void Main(string[] args)
  But entry_point = "top-level" in mist.toml means TLS is the entry point
  Calling Main explicitly to prove it is just a normal static method:
  Main called explicitly (not as entry point)
  Main args.Length: 2
  Disambiguation complete - Main is callable but not the entry point
